WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Quality engineering has two connected
opportunities in the AI era.

00:00:03.493 --> 00:00:08.480
We can use AI to help design tests,
investigate failures and maintain suites.

00:00:08.773 --> 00:00:12.880
We also need to evaluate the behavior
of AI-enabled applications.

00:00:13.056 --> 00:00:17.280
This presentation connects the industry
evidence to a shared capability,

00:00:17.307 --> 00:00:20.640
an operating model
and a measured adoption path.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:24.960
The central question is how
to improve validated delivery while

00:00:24.994 --> 00:00:28.960
strengthening the organization's
ability to judge the work.
